{
  "format": 1,
  "name": "aura_aura_and_rating",
  "spec": ["aura 6.15", "aura 8.3", "aura 17.10"],
  "description": "State 15: aura = clamp(base + transient), base -128 -> aura 0 and not counted (even with transient and population); rating = trunc(sum(a x pop) / sum(pop)) over the three residential population grids: (20, 300) and (-10, 100) -> trunc(5000 / 400) = 12; (-25, 1) and (0, 1) -> trunc(-12.5) = -12; population 0 -> 0; max / min with strict comparisons in x-outer order (tie at 127 between (3, 5) [100 + 30 clamped] and (5, 1): (3, 5) is visited first in x order -> location (14, 22)); low tracts below -50 listed in visit order; the history record 0x0A5CBF37 carries the rating; without the population grids the population counts as 0 [choice]. Hand-derived (Python check).",
